    lyrics: "[Intro]\nHey there, it's time to learn…\n\n[Hook]\nHello… Hola\nHow are you?… ¿Cómo estás?\nGood morning… Buenos días\nLet's go… Vámonos\n\n[Verse]\nAt the café, we meet today,\nSipping coffee, feeling great.\nGood afternoon… Buenas tardes\nTime to chat and celebrate.\nThank you… Gracias\nFor the treat, it's nice.\nPlease… Por favor\nPass the sugar, that's precise.\n\n[Hook]\nHello… Hola\nHow are you?… ¿Cómo estás?\nGood morning… Buenos días\nLet's go… Vámonos\n\n[Verse]\nThe sun sets, the sky's aglow,\nTime to say it, let them know.\nGood night… Buenas noches\nSee you soon, don't be late.\nYou're welcome… De nada\nFor the smiles we made.\nGoodbye… Adiós\nUntil we meet again, it's fate.\n\n[Bridge]\nIn this cozy little place,\nLearning words at our own pace.\nVery well… Muy bien\nIs what I say, feeling keen.\nOne more time, let's try again,\nPracticing until the end.\n\n[Hook]\nHello… Hola\nHow are you?… ¿Cómo estás?\nGood morning… Buenos días\nLet's go… Vámonos",
    vocab: [{"es":"hola","en":"hello"},{"es":"buenos días","en":"good morning"},{"es":"buenas tardes","en":"good afternoon"},{"es":"buenas noches","en":"good night"},{"es":"¿cómo estás?","en":"how are you?"},{"es":"muy bien","en":"very well"},{"es":"gracias","en":"thank you"},{"es":"por favor","en":"please"},{"es":"de nada","en":"you're welcome"},{"es":"adiós","en":"goodbye"},{"es":"me llamo...","en":"my name is..."},{"es":"soy de...","en":"I am from..."},{"es":"hasta luego","en":"see you later"},{"es":"con permiso","en":"excuse me"},{"es":"lo siento","en":"I'm sorry"}],
