    lyrics: "[Ad-lib]\nTime to rise and shine…\n\n[Hook]\nGood morning… Buenos días\nHow's it going… ¿Qué tal?\nNice to meet you… Encantado\nLet's start the day, let's go…\n\n[Verse]\nWoke up, feeling brand new,\ngotta get ready, what to do?\nBrush my teeth, comb my hair,\ngot my backpack, I'm almost there.\nGreetings… Saludos\nGood day… Buen día\nTake care… Cuídate\nHave a great day, okay?\n\n[Hook]\nGood morning… Buenos días\nHow's it going… ¿Qué tal?\nNice to meet you… Encantado\nLet's start the day, let's go…\n\n[Verse]\nRunning late, gotta fly,\ngrab my lunch, gotta say goodbye.\nSpeak slower… Habla más despacio\nPlease repeat… Repite por favor\nThank you too… Gracias igualmente\nEnjoy your meal… Buen provecho\nWith a smile, I head out,\nready to shout…\n\n[Bridge]\nHola… Hello\nDe nada… You're welcome\nThese words feel like a spell,\nlearning Spanish, can't you tell?\nIn the morning, in the night,\neverything's gonna be alright.\n\n[Hook]\nGood morning… Buenos días\nHow's it going… ¿Qué tal?\nNice to meet you… Encantado",
