    lyrics: "[Intro]\nAlright now, let's dive in.\n\n[Hook]\nCoffee and clouds… Café y nubes\nHere we go… Aquí vamos\nRain or shine… Lluvia o sol\nThis moment's ours… Este momento es nuestro\n\n[Verse]\nThe sun is shining… El sol brilla\nWindows wide open wide.\nA cool day… Un día fresco\nJust you and me, side by side.\nGood vibes… Buenas vibras\nWe feel it in the air.\nThe wind is blowing… El viento sopla\nWhispering everywhere.\n\n[Hook]\nCoffee and clouds… Café y nubes\nHere we go… Aquí vamos\nRain or shine… Lluvia o sol\nThis moment's ours… Este momento es nuestro\n\n[Verse]\nWhite clouds… Nubes blancas\nFloating in the sky.\nThe bright moon… La luna clara\nLights up the night on high.\nA starry night… Una noche estrellada\nFull of dreams to share.\nThe blue sky… El cielo azul\nReminds us that we care.\n\n[Bridge]\nRain is falling… La lluvia cae\nBut we're warm inside.\nListening to the rhythm… Escuchando el ritmo\nOf the world outside.\nThankful for this day… Agradecidos por este día\nWith every sip and smile.",
