    lyrics: "Here we go…\n\n[Hook]\nGood vibes… Buenas vibras  \nLet's go… Vámonos  \nWindows down… Ventanas abajo  \nMusic loud… Música alta  \nCome ride with me today.\n\n[Verse]\nSunny day… Día soleado  \nMakes me feel okay.  \nCloudy sky… El cielo nublado  \nBut we're still on our way.  \nLight rain… La lluvia ligera  \nHits the glass so clear.  \nStrong wind… El viento fuerte  \nWhispers in my ear.\n\n[Hook]\nGood vibes… Buenas vibras  \nLet's go… Vámonos  \nWindows down… Ventanas abajo  \nMusic loud… Música alta  \nCome ride with me today.\n\n[Verse]\nThe sun rises… El sol sale  \nColors paint the sky.  \nHot day… El día caluroso  \nBut we're feeling high.  \nSnow falls… Nieva  \nOn the mountain's face.  \nFresh air… El aire fresco  \nFills this empty space.\n\n[Bridge]\nRainbow shines… El arcoíris brilla  \nColors all around.  \nIt is sunny… Hace sol  \nIn this perfect town.  \nIt is snowing… Nieva  \nIn the hills so high.  \nWith my friends beside me  \nWe watch the world go by.\n\n[Hook]\nGood vibes… Buenas vibras  ",
