    lyrics: "[Intro]\nHere we go\n\n[Hook]\nLet's travel… Vamos a viajar\nIn the red car… En el coche rojo\nRide with me… Viaja conmigo\nOne, two, let's go… Uno, dos, ¡vámonos!\n\n[Verse]\nWaking up, feeling free,\nTime to move, just you and me.\nGood morning… Buenos días\nThe day is calling us.\nThank you… Gracias\nFor this adventure.\nOut the door, we make our way,\nTo the station, let's not delay.\nWait for the train… Esperar el tren\nHear the whistle, here it comes again.\n\n[Hook]\nLet's travel… Vamos a viajar\nIn the red car… En el coche rojo\nRide with me… Viaja conmigo\nOne, two, let's go… Uno, dos, ¡vámonos!\n\n[Verse]\nDown the street, the buses roll,\nPeople coming, people go.\nGo by bus… Ir en autobús\nSee the city, feel the flow.\nTaxi cabs, they line the street,\nTake a taxi… Tomar un taxi\nQuick and easy, can't be beat.\nRiding bikes, we feel the breeze,\nRide a bicycle… Montar en bicicleta\nUnder trees, with such ease.\n\n[Bridge]\nSailing on the water blue,\nNavegar en barco, just me and you.",
