    lyrics: "¡Vamos!\n\n[Hook]\nHello… Hola\nWe… Nosotros\nYou… Tú\nYou all… Ustedes\nLet's go… Vámonos\n[Hook]\n\n[Verse]\nSun's up, it's time to rise,\ngetting ready, no surprise.\nI… Yo\nMe… Me\nBrush my teeth, check my hair,\ntoday's a day we all will share.\nThey… Ellos\nWe… Nosotros\nHurry up, don't be late,\nwe're heading out the gate.\nYou… Tú\nYou all… Ustedes\n[Verse]\n\n[Hook]\nHello… Hola\nWe… Nosotros\nYou… Tú\nYou all… Ustedes\nLet's go… Vámonos\n[Hook]\n\n[Verse]\nOut the door, down the street,\nwe meet our friends, it's hard to beat.\nTo them… Les\nUs… Nos\nWe laugh and talk, side by side,\nwith you all… Con ustedes\nWe take pride.\nHe… Él\nShe… Ella\nThey… Ellos\nTogether, we're a team,\nliving our dream.\nYou… Tú\n[Verse]\n\n[Bridge]\nIn the classroom, we all sit,\nlearning new words, bit by bit.\nMine… Mío\nYours… Tuyo\nReflect on what we know,\nas the lessons flow.\nReflexive… Reflexivo\nTo you… A ti\nWe help each other grow,\nin this journey, we all glow.\nUs… Nos\n[Bridge]\n\n[Hook]\nHello… Hola\nWe… Nosotros\nYou… Tú",
