    artistFeel: "Janis Joplin",
    language: "Spanish",
    lyrics: "Let's go… ¡Vamos!\n\n[Hook]\nHello… Hola\nThere is a fire.… Hay un incendio.\nCall for help.… Llama para pedir ayuda.\nWe’re here for you today.\n\n[Verse]\nMet new neighbors, friendly smiles,\nthey said \"Nice to meet you\" for miles.\nGood morning… Buenos días\nHow’s it going?… ¿Cómo va?\nIn case of trouble, they explained,\n\"Remember these words,\" they proclaimed.\nCall a tow truck.… Llama a la grúa.\nFind a shelter.… Busca un refugio.\nThere is a leak.… Hay una fuga.\nCut the power.… Corta la corriente.\n\n[Hook]\nHello… Hola\nTornado warning.… Alerta de tornado.\nI need a first aid kit.… Necesito un botiquín.\nWe’re here for you today.\n\n[Verse]\nHeard a noise, couldn’t see,\nasked them \"What could it be?\"\nThere is a lot of noise.… Hay mucho ruido.\nThey nodded, understood my worry.\nIn emergencies, stay calm they said,\nknow these words, keep them in your head.\nHelp is near.… La ayuda está cerca.\nCall the police.… Llama a la policía.\nStay inside.… Quédate adentro.",
    vocab: [{"es":"Hay un incendio.","en":"There is a fire."},{"es":"Llama a la grúa.","en":"Call a tow truck."},{"es":"Busca un refugio.","en":"Find a shelter."},{"es":"Hay una fuga.","en":"There is a leak."},{"es":"Corte la corriente.","en":"Cut the power."},{"es":"Alerta de tornado.","en":"Tornado warning."},{"es":"Necesito un botiquín.","en":"I need a first aid kit."},{"es":"Hay mucho ruido.","en":"There is a lot of noise."}],
