    lyrics: "Hey y'all… Hey y'all  \nTime to meet the folks next door  \nSun's up… Sun's up  \nLet's head on over, can't wait no more  \n\n[Hook]  \nHello… Hola  \nHow are you?… ¿Cómo estás?  \nNice to meet you… Mucho gusto  \nSmile and wave… Sonríe y saluda  \nCome on over, let's chat  \n\n[Verse]  \nGood morning… Buenos días  \nWe just moved in, it's so nice to see ya  \nVery well… Muy bien  \nWe're settling in, can't you tell?  \nThank you… Gracias  \nFor the warm welcome, it means a lot  \nPlease… Por favor  \nCome on in, let's share the spot  \n\n[Hook]  \nHello… Hola  \nHow are you?… ¿Cómo estás?  \nNice to meet you… Mucho gusto  \nSmile and wave… Sonríe y saluda  \nNeighbors now, let's hang  \n\n[Verse]  \nNeed some sugar… Azúcar por favor  \nWe're baking up something sweet for sure  \nYou're welcome… De nada  \nIt's what neighbors do, ain't it grand?  \nSee you later… Hasta luego  \nGotta run, but hey, let's meet again soon, amigo  \n\n[Bridge]  \nLife's a journey… La vida es un viaje  ",
