    lyrics: "[Intro]\nSun's up, waves are calling, let's go.\n\n[Hook]\nHello… Hola  \nHow are you?… ¿Cómo estás?  \nLet's talk and walk this sunny day.  \nNice to meet you… Encantado  \nCome join me… Ven conmigo  \nUnder the palm trees where we sway.\n\n[Verse]\nFeet in the sand, feeling the breeze,  \nWaves are dancing, putting us at ease.  \nGood vibes… Buenas vibras  \nUnder the sun's embrace.  \nHow's it going?… ¿Cómo te va?  \nTell me more… Cuéntame más  \nAbout your life and your ways.\n\n[Hook]\nHello… Hola  \nHow are you?… ¿Cómo estás?  \nLet's talk and walk this sunny day.  \nNice to meet you… Encantado  \nCome join me… Ven conmigo  \nUnder the palm trees where we sway.\n\n[Verse]\nWhere are you from?… ¿De dónde eres?  \nLet's share our stories, make new memories.  \nThank you… Gracias  \nFor your smile and your time.  \nWhat do you think?… ¿Qué opinas?  \nAbout the ocean's rhyme?  \nCan you repeat that?… ¿Puedes repetir?  \nI want to hear your words again.\n\n[Bridge]\nWhat's your number?… ¿Cuál es tu número?  ",
