    genre: "Rock",
    beat: "Calm Slow",
    artistFeel: "Nirvana",
    language: "Spanish",
    lyrics: "[Intro]\nHey, hey, we're on the road again...\n\n[Hook]\nNumbers in the air… Números en el aire\nLet's count from there… Vamos a contar desde allí\nSix, seven, eight… Seis, siete, ocho\nNine, ten, let's celebrate… Nueve, diez, vamos a celebrar\nVamos, amigos, let's go… Vamos, amigos, vamos.\n\n[Verse]\nSun's up high, we're feeling free,\nUno, dos, tres, just you and me.\nFour wheels spinning, cinco stars in sight,\nFour… Cuatro, five… Cinco, under the moonlight.\nWindows down, the music's loud,\nSeis amigos, feeling proud.\nSeven… Siete, miles to go,\nEight… Ocho, more to know.\n\n[Hook]\nNumbers in the air… Números en el aire\nLet's count from there… Vamos a contar desde allí\nSix, seven, ocho… Seis, siete, ocho\nNine, diez, let's celebrate… Nueve, diez, vamos a celebrar\nVamos, amigos, let's go… Vamos, amigos, vamos.\n\n[Verse]\nNine… Nueve, clouds in the sky,\nTen… Diez, dreams passing by.\nWe're singing loud, feeling alive,\nTres, cuatro, cinco, let's come alive.\nSeven… Siete, mountains in our way,",
