    lyrics: "[Intro]\nSandy shores and sunny skies...\n\n[Hook]\nWaves are crashing… Las olas rompiendo\nCounting stars… Contando estrellas\nLet's unwind… Relajémonos\nOne, two, three… Uno, dos, tres\nFeel the rhythm of the sea.\n\n[Verse]\nZero point five… Cero coma cinco\nSeagulls fly… Gaviotas vuelan\nA quarter… Un cuarto\nOf the day is gone.\nSand between our toes… Arena entre los dedos\nThree quarters… Tres cuartos\nOf fun, come on!\nOne fifth… Un quinto\nOf the sunset's glow.\nTwo thirds… Dos tercios\nOf the ocean's flow.\n\n[Hook]\nWaves are crashing… Las olas rompiendo\nCounting stars… Contando estrellas\nLet's unwind… Relajémonos\nOne, two, three… Uno, dos, tres\nFeel the rhythm of the sea.\n\n[Verse]\nOne eighth… Un octavo\nOf the night is near.\nOne hundred percent… Cien por ciento\nOf smiles and cheer.\nOne trillion… Un billón\nStars up in the sky.\nSeis… Six\nFootsteps in the sand.\nSiete… Seven\nDreams hand in hand.\n\n[Bridge]\nLa luna brilla… The moon is bright\nReflecting on the water.\nEl sonido… The sound",
