    language: "Spanish",
    lyrics: "[Intro]\nHey! Let’s count the waves today…\n\n[Hook]\nUno, dos… One, two\nVamos a la playa… Going to the beach\nTres, cuatro… Three, four\nLearning numbers in the sun’s glow.\n\n[Verse]\nSun’s up, it’s a beautiful day,\nVamos a contar… Let’s count okay?\nZero point one… Cero coma uno\nMitad de cinco… Half of five, here we go.\nDouble of six… Doble de seis\nTercio de nueve… One third of nine, mix it quick.\nOne fourth of twelve… Cuarta parte de doce\nDécuplo de dos… Ten times two, can’t you tell?\n\n[Hook]\nUno, dos… One, two\nVamos a la playa… Going to the beach\nTres, cuatro… Three, four\nLearning numbers in the sun’s glow.\n\n[Verse]\nTriple of three… Triple de tres\nCuádruple de cuatro… Quadruple of four, can’t you see?\nThe ocean’s wide, the sky’s so blue,\nA perfect day for me and you.\nUno, dos… One, two\nTres, cuatro… Three, four\nCounting numbers, what a fun chore.\n\n[Bridge]\nFeel the breeze, hear the sea,\nLearning Spanish, just you and me.\nLet’s shout it out, let’s have some fun,",
