    lyrics: "[Intro]\n(Rain pattering on the window)\n\n[Hook]\nRed… Rojo\nBlue… Azul\nLet’s learn today… Aprendamos hoy\nIn the rain… Bajo la lluvia\nColors everywhere… Colores por doquier\nCome and sing with me.\n\n[Verse]\nWaking up, it’s pouring down,\nGray skies… Cielos grises\nBut we’re painting smiles, not a frown.\nGreen… Verde\nThe trees outside are swaying slow.\nYellow… Amarillo\nThe sun will shine, I know.\n\n[Hook]\nRed… Rojo\nBlue… Azul\nLet’s learn today… Aprendamos hoy\nIn the rain… Bajo la lluvia\nColors everywhere… Colores por doquier\nCome and sing with me.\n\n[Verse]\nBlack… Negro\nThe clouds above, so big and wide.\nWhite… Blanco\nThe little lights that glow inside.\nA rainbow waits for us to see,\nColors in the air, can’t you feel the melody?\n\n[Bridge]\nLook around, what do you see?\nA world of colors, wild and free.\nOrange… Naranja\nPurple… Morado\nEvery shade, a story told.\nIn this moment, let it unfold.\n\n[Hook]\nRed… Rojo\nBlue… Azul\nLet’s learn today… Aprendamos hoy\nIn the rain… Bajo la lluvia",
