    lyrics: "[Intro]\nPack the car, grab the map, we’re hitting the road.\nSpanish lessons with the crew, everybody knows.\n\n[Hook]\nWhite… Blanco\nPink… Rosa\nOrange… Naranja\nColors shining as we go.\nRed… Rojo\nBlue… Azul\nLet’s sing loud… Cantemos fuerte\nUnder the sky so blue.\n\n[Verse]\nWindows down, we’re cruising by,\nFeel the wind, the sun so high.\nYellow… Amarillo\nFields of gold, can’t you see?\nGreen… Verde\nTrees are waving, wild and free.\nTurn it up, let’s make a scene,\nWith the colors of the day.\n\n[Hook]\nWhite… Blanco\nPink… Rosa\nOrange… Naranja\nColors shining as we go.\nRed… Rojo\nBlue… Azul\nLet’s sing loud… Cantemos fuerte\nUnder the sky so blue.\n\n[Verse]\nStop for snacks, a little break,\nLaugh and talk, what’s at stake?\nPurple… Morado\nGrapes are sweet, taste the flavor.\nBrown… Marrón\nCoffee in hand, we savor.\nEvery mile, a new surprise,\nWith the colors of the skies.\n\n[Bridge]\nHey, hey, hey… Let’s keep the pace.\nFeel the rhythm, feel the bass.\nColors everywhere we look,",
