    lyrics: "[Intro]\nRaindrops… Got me dreaming…\n\n[Hook]\nColors all around… Colores por todas partes\nDancing on the ground… Bailando en el suelo\nRainy morning sound… Sonido de la mañana lluviosa\nVamos a cantar… Come on, sing along.\nPerla… Pearl, shining bright.\n\n[Verse]\nGood morning… Buenos días\nThe sky's crying, but I'm smiling.\nRojo… Red umbrella, keep me dry.\nAzul… Blue rain boots, let's fly high.\nDorado claro… Light gold sunlight breaking through.\nChampán… Champagne dreams in my cozy room.\nMelocotón… Peach clouds up above, feeling so alive.\nSalvia… Sage-colored walls, where I find my vibe.\n\n[Hook]\nColors all around… Colores por todas partes\nDancing on the ground… Bailando en el suelo\nRainy morning sound… Sonido de la mañana lluviosa\nVamos a cantar… Come on, sing along.\nPerla… Pearl, shining bright.\n\n[Verse]\nTerracota… Terracotta pots, flowers in bloom.\nMarfil… Ivory dreams in my little room.\nAzul cielo… Sky blue curtains, let the light in.\nEnglish… Español, let's begin again.",
