    artistFeel: "Anitta",
    language: "Spanish",
    lyrics: "[Intro]\nIt's a special day, everybody's here…\nFamily gathering, can't wait to cheer!\n\n[Hook]\nHappy birthday… Feliz cumpleaños\nBalloons flying… Globos volando\nLet's celebrate… Vamos a celebrar\nFamily's here… La familia está aquí\nWe're all together, one, two, three…\n\n[Verse]\nLaughter's in the air, the cake's ready…\nEl pastel está listo, cantemos tan dulcemente.\nThe mother… La madre, she's smiling so bright.\nThe father… El padre, he's laughing all night.\nEl hermano, he's dancing, having such fun.\nLa hermana, she's singing, under the sun.\n\n[Hook]\nHappy birthday… Feliz cumpleaños\nBalloons flying… Globos volando\nLet's celebrate… Vamos a celebrar\nFamily's here… La familia está aquí\nWe're all together, one, two, three…\n\n[Verse]\nThe son… El hijo, he's blowing out the light.\nCandles flicker, wishes taking flight.\nWe're singing loud, voices in harmony.\nTodos estamos juntos, es una sinfonía familiar.\nThe gifts are wrapped, sorpresas to explore.",
