    lyrics: "[Intro]\nHey… We're here to celebrate!\n\n[Hook]\nFamily time… Tiempo en familia\nLaughter and smiles… Risas y sonrisas\nCome on now… Venga, vamos\nCelebrate… Celebremos\nBlow out the candles tonight.\n\n[Verse]\nGather 'round… Reúnanse\nThe table's set, food's looking great.\nThe daughter… La hija\nShe's dancing with her abuelo.\nThe father… El padre\nHe's laughing with his friends.\nThe mother… La madre\nShe's taking pictures with her phone.\n\n[Hook]\nFamily time… Tiempo en familia\nLaughter and smiles… Risas y sonrisas\nCome on now… Venga, vamos\nCelebrate… Celebremos\nBlow out the candles tonight.\n\n[Verse]\nThe birthday boy… El cumpleañero\nHe's wearing a crown, feeling like a king.\nThe grandmother… La abuela\nShe's singing a song, her voice so sweet.\nThe grandfather… El abuelo\nHe's telling stories from the past.\nWe all listen… Todos escuchamos\nAs the memories last and last.\n\n[Bridge]\nGames and gifts… Juegos y regalos\nWrapping paper flying everywhere.\nWe laugh and play… Reímos y jugamos",
    vocab: [{"es":"la hija","en":"the daughter"},{"es":"el abuelo","en":"the grandfather"},{"es":"la abuela","en":"the grandmother"}],
