    artistFeel: "Kendrick Lamar",
    language: "Spanish",
    lyrics: "[Intro]\n(Vroom vroom) Let's hit the road, feel the beat, the rhythm flows.\n\n[Hook]\nVamos… Let's go\nEl viaje… The road trip\n¿Qué quieres?… What do you want?\nThe soup… La sopa\nThe salad… La ensalada\nThe coffee… El café\nThis is how we roll.\n\n[Verse]\nBajo el sol… Under the sun\nWe sing along, having fun.\nGood vibes… Buenas vibras\nMusic up, the world is ours.\nLa manzana… The apple\nCrunchy and sweet.\nEl plátano… The banana\nA perfect treat.\nWe laugh and talk, stories unfold,\nFriends on the road, stories told.\n\n[Hook]\nVamos… Let's go\nEl viaje… The road trip\n¿Qué quieres?… What do you want?\nThe soup… La sopa\nThe salad… La ensalada\nThe coffee… El café\nThis is how we roll.\n\n[Verse]\nParamos aquí… We stop right here\nAt this diner, atmosphere.\nOrder up, what do we say?\nEl menú… The menu\nPoints the way.\nPollo o carne… Chicken or beef\nChoices to make, nothing too brief.\nLa cuenta, por favor… The check, please\nGracias… Thank you\nFor the company and memories.\n\n[Bridge]",
