    beat: "Calm Slow",
    artistFeel: "Romeo Santos",
    language: "Spanish",
    lyrics: "[Intro]\nHey… Can you feel it?\n\n[Hook]\nFeelings… Sentimientos\nHappy… Feliz\nSad… Triste\nCome on, let’s sing.\nFeelings… Sentimientos\nTired… Cansado\nAngry… Enojado\nLet the joy ring.\n\n[Verse]\nBirthday candles, shining bright,\nEveryone’s here, feeling alright.\nContent… Contento\nWe’re dancing through the night.\nLaughter echoes, smiles so wide,\nIn this moment, hearts open wide.\nA hug… Un abrazo\nSays more than words could say.\nWaving hands… Manos arriba\nAs we sway.\n\n[Hook]\nFeelings… Sentimientos\nHappy… Feliz\nSad… Triste\nCome on, let’s sing.\nFeelings… Sentimientos\nTired… Cansado\nAngry… Enojado\nLet the joy ring.\n\n[Verse]\nFaces glowing in the light,\nSharing stories, feeling so right.\nExcited… Emocionado\nFor the memories we’ll make.\nGrateful… Agradecido\nFor the friends we have today.\nA laugh… Una risa\nFills the room with cheer.\nLoving this… Amando esto\nAs we gather near.\n\n[Bridge]\nIn this moment, everything’s clear,\nNo worries, just love, nothing to fear.\nConnected… Conectados",
    vocab: [{"es":"feliz","en":"happy"},{"es":"triste","en":"sad"},{"es":"cansado","en":"tired"},{"es":"enojado","en":"angry"},{"es":"contento","en":"content / glad"}],
