    beat: "Energetic Normal",
    artistFeel: "Shakira",
    language: "Spanish",
    lyrics: "[Intro]\nSunny day at the beach, feeling free…\n\n[Hook]\nHappy… Feliz\nHow do you feel?… ¿Cómo te sientes?\nSad… Triste\nLet it out… Sácalo\nFeelings in the sun.\n\n[Verse]\nWaves are crashing, seagulls fly,\nSurprised… Sorprendido by the ocean's cry.\nNervous… Nervioso, heart beats fast,\nProud… Orgulloso of the moments that last.\nWalking on the sand, feeling the heat,\nFear… Miedo fades when our hands meet.\nWell… Bien, I’m doing just fine,\nEmbarrassed… Avergonzado, but you’re by my side.\n\n[Hook]\nHappy… Feliz\nHow do you feel?… ¿Cómo te sientes?\nSad… Triste\nLet it out… Sácalo\nFeelings in the sun.\n\n[Verse]\nGuilty… Culpable for the time we lost,\nImpatient… Impaciente for the tide to cross.\nLaughter in the air, smiles all around,\nIn this moment, love is found.\nThe sun is shining, the world feels right,\nWith you here, everything’s bright.\nFeelings come, feelings go,\nIn the sun's warm glow.\n\n[Bridge]\nLet the rhythm move your soul,\nIn this sunny, coastal stroll.\nFeelings deep, like the sea,",
    vocab: [{"es":"sorprendido","en":"surprised"},{"es":"nervioso","en":"nervous"},{"es":"orgulloso","en":"proud"},{"es":"miedo","en":"fear"},{"es":"bien","en":"well"},{"es":"avergonzado","en":"embarrassed"},{"es":"culpable","en":"guilty"},{"es":"impaciente","en":"impatient"}],
