    totalLessons: 20,
    genre: "Country",
    beat: "Calm Normal",
    artistFeel: "Ella Langley",
    language: "Spanish",
    lyrics: "[Intro]\n(Hey, can I get a coffee, please?)\n\n[Hook]\nAt the café… En la cafetería\nTime flies by… El tiempo pasa\nMorning light… Luz de la mañana\nLet's learn today… Aprendamos hoy\nThe clock is ticking… El reloj avanza\n\n[Verse]\nSitting here, sipping my tea,\nfeeling calm, feeling free.\nThe hour… La hora\nThe minute… El minuto\nEvery second counts, can't you see?\nWhat time is it?… ¿qué hora es?\nIt's one o'clock… Es la una\nIt's two o'clock… Son las dos\nTime to learn, let's hit the clock.\n\n[Hook]\nAt the café… En la cafetería\nTime flies by… El tiempo pasa\nMorning light… Luz de la mañana\nLet's learn today… Aprendamos hoy\nThe clock is ticking… El reloj avanza\n\n[Verse]\nPeople come, people go,\nin this cozy little show.\nA greeting… Un saludo\nGood vibes… Buenas vibras\nLet's chat and laugh, let it flow.\nThe sun sets… El sol se pone\nNight arrives… Llega la noche\nUnder the stars, our dreams roam.\n\n[Bridge]\nIn this moment, right here, right now,\nwe're learning fast, we'll figure it out.",
    vocab: [{"es":"la hora","en":"the hour"},{"es":"el minuto","en":"the minute"},{"es":"¿qué hora es?","en":"what time is it?"},{"es":"es la una","en":"it's one o'clock"},{"es":"son las dos","en":"it's two o'clock"}],
