    genre: "Rock",
    beat: "Chill Normal",
    artistFeel: "Heart",
    language: "Spanish",
    lyrics: "[Intro]\n(Soft rain sounds)\n\n[Hook]\nRain is falling… La lluvia cae\nTime to learn… Hora de aprender\nMorning's here… La mañana está aquí\nLet's begin… Empecemos\n\n[Verse]\nEarly morning… Mañana temprano\nCoffee in my hand, feeling so grand.\nAt noon… Al mediodía\nThe sun peeks through, skies so blue.\nIn the afternoon… Por la tarde\nI watch the clouds, feeling so free.\nDusk arrives… Anochecer\nThe day goes by, oh so fast.\n\n[Hook]\nRain is falling… La lluvia cae\nTime to learn… Hora de aprender\nMorning's here… La mañana está aquí\nLet's begin… Empecemos\n\n[Verse]\nHalf an hour… Media hora\nPasses by, time flies like a bird.\nQuarter of an hour… Un cuarto de hora\nTick-tock goes the clock, can't you hear?\nBefore the hour… Antes de la hora\nI set my watch, never be late.\nAfter the hour… Después de la hora\nTime moves on, it's never fake.\n\n[Bridge]\nLa hora, el minuto\nTick-tock, tick-tock, can't you see?\nIn this rainy day, cozy and free.\nLearning Spanish, just you and me.\n\n[Hook]",
