    artistFeel: "Heart",
    language: "Spanish",
    lyrics: "[Intro]\nHey there… Hey there…\n\n[Hook]\nHello… Hola\nHow are you?… ¿Cómo estás?\nLet's learn… Aprendamos\nOne, two, three… Uno, dos, tres\nCome sing along with me.\n\n[Verse]\nAt the café, sipping my drink,\nthe school… la escuela, it's where we think.\nOpen the book… el libro, turn the page,\nthe pencil… el lápiz, ready to engage.\nOn the paper… el papel, we write our dreams,\nthe student… el estudiante, in this world it seems.\nWe laugh and chat, sharing our day,\ngood morning… buenos días, let's seize the day.\n\n[Hook]\nHello… Hola\nHow are you?… ¿Cómo estás?\nLet's learn… Aprendamos\nOne, two, three… Uno, dos, tres\nCome sing along with me.\n\n[Verse]\nThe sun is shining through the window pane,\nthank you… gracias, for this moment, plain and sane.\nWe practice words, we learn and grow,\nthe future's bright… el futuro es brillante, watch it glow.\nWith every phrase, we build a bridge,\nthe language of life… el idioma de la vida, a sweet pledge.\nWe sip our coffee, time flies by,",
