    lyrics: "[Intro]\n(Let's get this party started!)\n\n[Hook]\nIn the classroom… En la clase\nWe all gather… Nos reunimos\nTime to learn… Hora de aprender\nBirthday fun… Fiesta de cumple\nHey, hey, hey… Vamos a jugar\n\n[Verse]\nBalloons are floating, laughter in the air,\nThe blackboard… La pizarra, teacher's drawing there.\nThe eraser… El borrador, cleaning up the board,\nThe pen… El bolígrafo, stories to be scored.\n\nThank you… Gracias, for the gift you gave,\nThe pencil sharpener… El sacapuntas, keeping thoughts so brave.\nThe backpack… La mochila, full of dreams and more,\nThe dictionary… El diccionario, opening every door.\n\n[Hook]\nIn the classroom… En la clase\nWe all gather… Nos reunimos\nTime to learn… Hora de aprender\nBirthday fun… Fiesta de cumple\nHey, hey, hey… Vamos a jugar\n\n[Verse]\nThe computer… El ordenador, showing us the way,\nThe schedule… El horario, guiding every day.\nThe teacher… La maestra, with a smile so bright,\nMaking learning easy, turning on the light.\n",
