    lyrics: "[Intro]\n(Hey, it's your birthday, let's celebrate!)\n\n[Hook]\nBirthday party… La fiesta de cumpleaños\nBalloons flying… Globos volando\nLet's get to work… Vamos a trabajar\nSmile and sing… Sonríe y canta\nIt's your day… Es tu día\nNo time to lose… No hay tiempo que perder\n\n[Verse]\nThe driver… El chofer\nGot the cake in the back.\nThe boss… El jefe\nSaid, \"Take the day off, relax.\"\nIn the office… En la oficina\nWe were dreaming of this.\nNow we're dancing… Ahora estamos bailando\nUnder the moonlit bliss.\nThe teacher… El maestro\nTaught us how to groove.\nNow we're singing… Ahora estamos cantando\nLike there's nothing to prove.\n\n[Hook]\nBirthday party… La fiesta de cumpleaños\nBalloons flying… Globos volando\nLet's get to work… Vamos a trabajar\nSmile and sing… Sonríe y canta\nIt's your day… Es tu día\nNo time to lose… No hay tiempo que perder\n\n[Verse]\nGood vibes… Buenas vibras\nAll around the room.\nLaughter echoes… La risa resuena\nLike a sweet melody's tune.\nThe job… El trabajo",
