    lyrics: "[Intro]\nWoke up with the sun in my eyes…\n\n[Hook]\nSunny day… Día soleado\nAt the beach… En la playa\nWaves are calling… Las olas llaman\nLet's work and play… Vamos a trabajar y a jugar\nLet's learn today.\n\n[Verse]\nThe shoemaker… El zapatero\nFixing shoes by the shore.\nThe butcher… El carnicero\nGrilling meat, who could want more?\nThe fruit vendor… El frutero\nSelling mangoes and limes.\nThe dressmaker… La modista\nSewing dreams in no time.\n\n[Hook]\nSunny day… Día soleado\nAt the beach… En la playa\nWaves are calling… Las olas llaman\nLet's work and play… Vamos a trabajar y a jugar\nLet's learn today.\n\n[Verse]\nThe locksmith… El cerrajero\nKeys jingling in his hand.\nThe florist… El florista\nMaking bouquets from the sand.\nThe seamstress… La costurera\nStitching smiles so bright.\nThe blacksmith… El herrero\nForging dreams in the light.\n\n[Bridge]\nThe driver… El chofer\nCruising down the coast.\nThe boss… El jefe\nCalling out goals like a ghost.\nWe’re learning and working… Aprendiendo y trabajando",
