    language: "Spanish",
    lyrics: "[Intro]\n(Walking on the shore, feeling free)\n\n[Hook]\nSunshine… El sol\nWaves in line… Olas en fila\nChill vibes… Buenas vibras\nUnder the sky… Bajo el cielo\nCome take a walk with me.\n\n[Verse]\nThe cactus… El cactus\nStands so tall by the sea.\nThe hill… La colina\nCalls us to climb and see.\nFootprints in the sand,\nNature's art so grand.\nThe swamp… El pantano\nWhere creatures roam.\nThe campfire… La fogata\nGlows, we're never alone.\n\n[Hook]\nSunshine… El sol\nWaves in line… Olas en fila\nChill vibes… Buenas vibras\nUnder the sky… Bajo el cielo\nCome take a walk with me.\n\n[Verse]\nThe spider web… La telaraña\nCatches the morning dew.\nThe fox… El zorro\nDarts by, a flash of brown hue.\nBy the pond… El estanque\nWe watch the fish play.\nThe sunset… La puesta de sol\nPaints the world in a golden array.\n\n[Bridge]\nLa luna rises high,\nStars in the sky… Las estrellas brillan así.\nNature's lullaby,\nGuiding our way tonight.\n\n[Hook]\nSunshine… El sol\nWaves in line… Olas en fila\nChill vibes… Buenas vibras",
    vocab: [{"es":"el cactus","en":"the cactus"},{"es":"la colina","en":"the hill"},{"es":"el pantano","en":"the swamp"},{"es":"la fogata","en":"the campfire"},{"es":"la telaraña","en":"the spider web"},{"es":"el zorro","en":"the fox"},{"es":"el estanque","en":"the pond"},{"es":"la puesta de sol","en":"the sunset"}],
