    language: "Spanish",
    lyrics: "[Intro]\nHey y'all, gather 'round…\nGot some new neighbors in town.\n\n[Hook]\nNew friends… Nuevos amigos\nCome and see… Ven a ver\nWhere we go… A dónde vamos\nYou and me… Tú y yo\nExploring places, oh so free.\n\n[Verse]\nStrolling down the avenue,\nPlaces to be, things to do.\nIce cream shop… La heladería\nSweet treats for you and me.\nNightclub's calling… La discoteca\nDance the night away.\nZoo's alive… El zoológico\nAnimals on parade.\n\n[Hook]\nNew friends… Nuevos amigos\nCome and see… Ven a ver\nWhere we go… A dónde vamos\nYou and me… Tú y yo\nExploring places, oh so free.\n\n[Verse]\nAquarium's bright… El acuario\nFishes swimming 'round.\nFire station's bold… La estación de bomberos\nHeroes standing proud.\nStadium's roar… El estadio\nGames and cheers abound.\nAirport's high… El aeropuerto\nPlanes taking flight.\n\n[Bridge]\nMarina's calm… El puerto deportivo\nBoats on the bay.\nRestaurant's warm… El restaurante\nDinner's served today.\nPharmacy's near… La farmacia\nFor when you need aid.",
