    language: "Spanish",
    lyrics: "[Intro]\nHey, let's get this party started… on wheels!\n\n[Hook]\nWheels spinning… Ruedas girando\nLet's go… Vámonos\nBirthday fun… Fiesta de cumpleaños\nHere we go… Aquí vamos\nCruising to the beat.\n\n[Verse]\nHappy birthday… Feliz cumpleaños\nShout it out, everybody scream.\nThe car… El coche\nRiding smooth, feeling free.\nThe bus… El autobús\nPacked with friends and family.\nStreetlights glowing, music's loud,\nDancing in the crowd.\n\n[Hook]\nWheels spinning… Ruedas girando\nLet's go… Vámonos\nBirthday fun… Fiesta de cumpleaños\nHere we go… Aquí vamos\nCruising to the beat.\n\n[Verse]\nThe train… El tren\nWhistles blowing, night is young.\nThe airplane… El avión\nFlying high, touching the sky.\nThe bicycle… La bicicleta\nRiding through the park, feeling alive.\nLaughter echoes, stars above,\nFilled with joy and love.\n\n[Bridge]\nThrough the city, through the night,\nEvery turn feels so right.\nCome on, friends, together on the road… Vamos, amigos, juntos en el camino\nCelebrating life, feeling the rhythm.\n",
