    lyrics: "[Intro]\nRain's pouring, can't go out,\nbut our journey's just begun.\n\n[Hook]\nVamos… Let's go\nIn the rain… En la lluvia\nThe taxi… El taxi\nEl coche… The car\nAdventure's calling, can't you hear?\n\n[Verse]\nEl autobús… The bus\nThrough puddles, we will glide.\nBuenos días… Good morning\nAs the world wakes up outside.\nThe boat… El barco\nSailing through the street.\nGracias… Thank you\nFor the ride, it's sweet.\nThe motorcycle… La moto\nZooming past the rain.\nHello… Hola\nHow's the view today?\n\n[Hook]\nVamos… Let's go\nIn the rain… En la lluvia\nThe taxi… El taxi\nEl coche… The car\nAdventure's calling, can't you hear?\n\n[Verse]\nEl mapa… The map\nGuiding us along.\nBuenas noches… Good night\nWhen the day is done.\nEl tren… The train\nRacing through the night.\nPor favor… Please\nHold on tight.\nLa bici… The bike\nPedaling through the storm.\nHola… Hello\nIsn't this so warm?\n\n[Bridge]\nThrough the storm, we find our way,\nlearning as we go each day.\nIn the rain, our spirits fly,",
