    artistFeel: "Glass Animals",
    language: "Spanish",
    lyrics: "[Intro]\nRainy morning, can't you see?\nLooking for ways to get around with me.\n\n[Hook]\nThe ship… La nave\nThe tram… El tranvía\nLet's find a way… Vamos a encontrar\nOn this rainy day… En este día lluvioso.\nCome sail with me again.\n\n[Verse]\nThrough the window, I can see,\nThe blimp… El dirigible, floating with glee.\nThe skateboard… La patineta, rides on the street,\nWhile the rain taps a rhythm so sweet.\nThe cable car… El teleférico, climbs up so high,\nTaking us to the sky.\nThank you… Gracias, for this moment in time,\nLet's make it feel just right.\n\n[Hook]\nThe ship… La nave\nThe tram… El tranvía\nLet's find a way… Vamos a encontrar\nOn this rainy day… En este día lluvioso.\nCome sail with me again.\n\n[Verse]\nIn the rain, we find our way,\nThe canoe… La canoa, paddles through the grey.\nThe spaceship… La nave espacial, waits for the sun,\nBut for now, let's just have some fun.\nThe taxi… El taxi, honks its horn,\nAs the rain keeps falling, a new day is born.",
