    artistFeel: "Earth Wind and Fire",
    language: "Spanish",
    lyrics: "[Intro]\n(Let's get this party started!)\n\n[Hook]\nHappy birthday… Feliz cumpleaños\nTurn it up… Súbele el volumen\nClick, click, flash… Flash, flash, clic\nCapture the moment… Captura el momento\nLet's celebrate tonight.\n\n[Verse]\nThe phone… El teléfono\nRings and we sing along.\nThe computer… La computadora\nShows us the best songs.\nThe internet… El internet\nKeeps us all connected.\nThe screen… La pantalla\nLights up with every color.\nThe email… El correo\nBrings wishes from afar.\nWe're dancing, we're laughing.\n\n[Hook]\nHappy birthday… Feliz cumpleaños\nTurn it up… Súbele el volumen\nClick, click, flash… Flash, flash, clic\nCapture the moment… Captura el momento\nLet's celebrate tonight.\n\n[Verse]\nThe music's loud… La música está fuerte\nWe feel the beat.\nLas luces… The lights\nMake everything complete.\nUn brindis… A toast\nTo memories we make.\nWith friends around… Con amigos aquí\nEvery second's a break.\nTechnology's our guide.\n\n[Bridge]\nLas velas… The candles\nGlow as we make a wish.",
