    genre: "90s",
    beat: "Chill Slow",
    artistFeel: "Backstreet Boys",
    language: "Spanish",
    lyrics: "[Intro]\nJust moved in next door.\n\n[Hook]\nHello… Hola\nHow are you?… ¿Cómo estás?\nNew neighbors, let's explore.\nOne, two, three… Uno, dos, tres\nCome and meet them with me.\n\n[Verse]\nWalking over, feeling shy,\nbut I give it a try.\nThe password… La contraseña\nTo unlock the day.\nThe camera… La cámara\nCaptures smiles on our way.\nThey say, \"Welcome… Bienvenidos\"\nWith a wave and a grin.\n\n[Hook]\nHello… Hola\nHow are you?… ¿Cómo estás?\nNew neighbors, let's explore.\nOne, two, three… Uno, dos, tres\nCome and meet them with me.\n\n[Verse]\nThe app… La aplicación\nHelps us chat and see.\nThe phone… El teléfono\nRings with a melody.\nThe computer… La computadora\nShows a map of the street.\nWe laugh and we talk,\nmaking memories so sweet.\n\n[Bridge]\nAs the sun sets low,\nwe share stories, letting go.\nIn this moment, we know,\nfriendship starts to grow.\nTechnology brings us near,\nbreaking the ice, no fear.\n\n[Hook]\nHello… Hola\nHow are you?… ¿Cómo estás?\nNew neighbors, let's explore.",
