    artistFeel: "Prince Royce",
    language: "Spanish",
    lyrics: "[Intro]\n(Soft guitar strumming)\n\n[Hook]\nWhat… Qué\nWho… Quién\nWhere… Dónde\nWhen… Cuándo\nWhy… Por qué\nCome sit with me again.\n\n[Verse]\nIn the café, we start the day,\nSipping coffee, got so much to say.\nWhat… Qué\nare you thinking right now?\nWho… Quién\nwill join us somehow?\nWhere… Dónde\ndid you get that smile?\nWhen… Cuándo\ncan we talk for a while?\nWhy… Por qué\nis the world so wide?\nQuestions fly, side by side.\n\n[Hook]\nWhat… Qué\nWho… Quién\nWhere… Dónde\nWhen… Cuándo\nWhy… Por qué\nCome sit with me again.\n\n[Verse]\nThe sun is shining through the glass,\nTime is slow, let it pass.\nWhat… Qué\ndo you dream about?\nWho… Quién\nare your friends, no doubt?\nWhere… Dónde\ndo you want to go?\nWhen… Cuándo\nwill we meet again, you know?\nWhy… Por qué\nis life so sweet?\nIn this moment, we feel complete.\n\n[Bridge]\n(Guitar solo)\n\n[Hook]\nWhat… Qué\nWho… Quién\nWhere… Dónde\nWhen… Cuándo\nWhy… Por qué\nCome sit with me again.\n\n[Verse]\nThe day is long, the night is near,\nMemories made, so crystal clear.\nWhat… Qué",
