    lyrics: "[Intro]\nIt's a rainy morning, and we're stuck inside, but learning Spanish feels just right.\n\n[Hook]\nIn the rain… En la lluvia\nWe're learning fast… Aprendemos rápido\nJust you and I… Tú y yo\nLet's take our time… Tomemos nuestro tiempo\nWe'll find our way.\n\n[Verse]\nWaking up, the world feels gray,\nbut we can learn and seize the day.\nMyself… Yo mismo\nYourself… Tú mismo\nWe can say it in so many ways.\nOurselves… Nosotros mismos\nYourselves… Ustedes mismos\nIn the mirror, see yourself and say.\nHimself/Herself/Itself… Sí mismo\nOneself… Uno mismo\nThese words will guide us through the fray.\n\n[Hook]\nIn the rain… En la lluvia\nWe're learning fast… Aprendemos rápido\nJust you and I… Tú y yo\nLet's take our time… Tomemos nuestro tiempo\nWe'll find our way.\n\n[Verse]\nThe rain taps softly on the pane,\nwhile we explore this language game.\nYourselves (informal)… Vosotros mismos\nWith himself/with herself/with itself… Consigo mismo\nIn Spain or here, the words remain.",
