    artistFeel: "Bad Bunny",
    language: "Spanish",
    lyrics: "[Intro]\nHey, hey…\n\n[Hook]\nHello… Hola\nWhat's the deal?… ¿Qué tal?\nLet's go… Vámonos\nNew friends today… Nuevos amigos hoy\nIn the neighborhood.\n\n[Verse]\nSaw a sign, \"Bienvenidos\"\nNeighbors moving in, can't you see?\nNice to meet you… Mucho gusto\nSmiling faces all around.\nLifeguard… Socorrista\nIf you need one by the pool.\nFirst aid kit… Botiquín\nJust in case, you know the rules.\nThe pet… La mascota\nRunning in the yard with glee.\nTow truck… Grúa\nIf your car gets stuck, oh me.\n\n[Hook]\nHello… Hola\nWhat's the deal?… ¿Qué tal?\nLet's go… Vámonos\nNew friends today… Nuevos amigos hoy\nIn the neighborhood.\n\n[Verse]\nHeard a sound, \"¡Cuidado!\"\nStorm is coming, skies look gray.\nStorm… Tormenta\nBetter find some shelter fast.\nSeat belt… Cinturón\nAlways buckle up, don't delay.\nOfficer… Agente\nKeeping us safe on the way.\nInjury… Herida\nIf you fall, we'll help you stay.\n\n[Bridge]\nThe ambulance… La ambulancia\nOn its way if you should call.\nNeighbors helping neighbors, that's the way we roll.",
